  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "5239bfa4-587b-4abe-8980-9bcaf99112fa"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the vertices equidistant from p1, \[Ellipsis], pn, as a sorted vertex list; \
a trailing {lo, hi} thickens each bisector to a slab"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"4e19fca4-e31c-4c3d-9738-5b623de18750"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["FindInfraSphere"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/FindInfraSphere", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "1e2639df-95fa-4876-9359-2e2b3b5962b9"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "n inclusion-minimal connected subsets of the shell of c that separate its \
inside from its outside; Properties and Method choose the class and the search"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"824df220-f2b9-44f6-9b14-d0fe97591156"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["FindInfraSegment"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/FindInfraSegment", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
