  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "e3161fd5-27e3-4229-8250-1c7d951404d7"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "one arc around c through the points as a vertex list; a trailing count \
gives a List of them"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"edc97168-734c-4bde-9a87-e433a1250535"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["FindInfraCircle"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/FindInfraCircle", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "5efaab02-aa4b-4496-a056-c82a6d93df3f"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "one circle around c through p as a cyclic vertex list; a trailing count \
gives a List of them"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"5f42c898-f090-481b-be31-88005977d716"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Measurements", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"1c433218-b159-433a-88e2-c8d9be75a922"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraMeasurement"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraMeasurement", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "2114456b-0964-4a72-826d-c7dfae5f2b42"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "a property of a head on a graph: \"Graph\", \"Cardinality\", \"Length\", \
\"VertexDensity\", \"EdgeDensity\", \"Subgraph\", \"Faithful\", \
\"CountingMeasure\" and \"RiemannianMeasure\"; a List of properties gives an \
Association, All gives every property"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"383abfd3-f0ac-45cd-90f9-e968e4894468"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraDensity"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraDensity", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "c5d1c5a1-9d4f-4223-b2f6-7205dafccee7"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the marginal of any shape to the vertex set with respect to the counting \
measure: a vertex, a vertex list, a density, a walk graph; the one coercion \
in the API"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"91a22669-7199-4020-8db9-db6844f80bd8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["FindInfraRepresentative"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/FindInfraRepresentative", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "15788c93-3abe-40d8-bc9d-ad890dfbb517"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "one member of a head as a vertex list, read off its graph or found by its \
search; a trailing count gives a List of them, \"RandomChoice\" a random \
member"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"61cf030f-f7ca-4b23-a1e1-9e22386fc352"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraMemberQ"]], 
