  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "3aefdb6e-c6d6-4503-8407-e658fb1a952b"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "whether a vertex list is a member of a head on a graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"d04ea0da-ee64-4f1a-a1cc-37bfa180323c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Substrates and Drawing", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"62c03df4-0bfc-46ab-bdda-f5599de3fe2f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraSubstrate"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraSubstrate", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "95e9d47e-f549-4572-836b-c94ff63f13de"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the named example substrates at size \"Small\", \"Medium\" or \"Large\": \
the tilings, meshes and closed surfaces the other pages draw on; \
InfraSubstrate[] lists the roster"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"1047b5c1-f582-4850-919a-d45052614b13"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraSubstrateHighlight"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraSubstrateHighlight", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "ab9a0c7a-38a4-432c-86c1-c3d5f56b86dc"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the summed densities of a list of objects drawn on a graph, the i-th object \
in the i-th palette color; a Directive styles the objects after it"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"0ebdc0b0-9454-45db-84fe-018c64f07a13"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Multi-constructions", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"4eb96ff1-262a-41af-9bc7-68dc1227db04"],

Cell["\<\
Whereas the causal graph of Euclidean constructions is causally invariant, \
the branchial graphs in infrageometry are non-trivial due to \
multi-constructions.\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"15ea1919-e156-4809-8125-75be880c04c4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraScene"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraScene", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "0fd07041-145e-4a05-ba4d-5610e54b98c4"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "a construction stated before any graph: the objects, and hypotheses that \
construct them with inert heads or assert relations between them"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"506dddcd-e935-472a-8d4b-a5f3a84a2a52"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraStep"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraStep", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "49422714-d47b-4cbb-8fdc-321b27a1c1f6"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "one construction encapsulated as a step of a scene; a second argument \
labels it"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"bd5c2eb8-135b-453d-b77c-8e3f34332db6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["FindInfraScene"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/FindInfraScene", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "9ffcf911-db57-437e-911e-ce28054a4c6c"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "a scene solved on a graph, step by step; a List of bindings, one per \
admissible combination"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"8e70a1a9-3c17-425a-b63f-fcc80db63e25"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraSceneInstance"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraSceneInstance", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "1267ba36-765f-4035-81fc-f16a0ecc043f"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "one solved binding of a scene; with an object name, reads that object out \
of it"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"6e02ffa8-bdeb-4fac-8d5e-41ca89803acd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraSceneViewer"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraSceneViewer", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "8cfb90cc-c7c4-417b-ab8e-281bb8b8d6fb"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "a step-by-step view of a scene on a graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"01059c1f-3b65-4b9f-9ca6-c9cf06975806"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Underlying graphs", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"d1393767-957a-4f4f-8409-5cafacf0224b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SprayGraph"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/SprayGraph", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "0512f150-cb5b-4eea-8c56-ec813bde64fc"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the breadth-first DAG rooted at c, whose source-to-sink paths are exactly \
the maximal shortest paths from c"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"b0304fc6-9536-4672-ac55-63f97ed92e82"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Not here", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"b9a5c446-4667-4f9c-9a69-0c801c7609de"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["FindBallHull"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/FindBallHull", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "d160b519-2d97-473c-9f75-3e9570a70b7d"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the intersection of all balls containing a set of points; it lives on the \
Infra Topology guide"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"f9f2c0eb-3489-4129-a9d2-421263d8ea83"],

Cell["\<\
not here: the quadric as an inert head and the layers of the convex hull; \
FindInfraQuadric stays on the Experimental guide\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"426048f0-4c72-4a49-a7c8-9cd1abf672c6"],

Cell["\<\
not here: an invariant of four points, the inverse of every head (the values \
of its unknowns for a given vertex set), and the graph of a line or of an arc \
as an exported name; none is in an item yet\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"636ab8c2-22d5-4739-8ca6-2052da2b993f"],

Cell["\<\
not here: the interactive multi-construction stepper in the causal and \
branchial direction; it stays on the Experimental guide\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"d401580c-ee9a-4570-b4d1-3a2553fb7c5c"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

